('List of tables and figures', ['Tables summarize role permissions, requirements, entities, test scenarios, route groups and operating procedures. Text-based flow descriptions are used where no authoritative diagram asset exists in the repository.', 'Add screenshots from the running application only after capturing them from a properly configured environment. Each image should include a figure number, descriptive caption, date captured and a note if demo data is shown. Avoid exposing real student or guardian information in screenshots.'], [['Item','Description'],['Tables','Requirements, roles, data dictionary, test cases, route groups and checklists'],['Figures to add','System context, deployment topology, data relationships, exam lifecycle and user journeys']]),
